# Core project rule

- Read `AGENTS.md` and its required docs before editing.
- Keep work inside the documented V1 scope.
- Never expose internal qualification data to a lead.
- Never commit secrets or real PII.
- Run `pnpm check` and focused tests before finishing.
- Record material architecture changes in `docs/DECISIONS.md`.
